  "body": "Sometimes, it all comes down to timing. If you've considered this property before, or perhaps overlooked it, now could be the time to take another look. With our vendor committed to a new venture, there's genuine motivation to get a deal done.\r\n\r\nAnd the bonus? The property is vacant, so you could be settling in and celebrating Christmas in your new home!\r\n\r\n* Motivated Vendor: Committed to their next venture and ready to make a move.\r\n* Great Location: An easy stroll to Mairangi Bay village and beach, zoned for Rangitoto College and just minutes from the Constellation motorway link.\r\n* Sunshine: A warm northerly aspect welcomes natural light and sunshine into the home.\r\n* Flexible Living: Visually appealing, with a spacious and versatile floorplan, two ensuite bedrooms, open-plan living and a generous master retreat.\r\n* Easy Care: A lift connecting all levels, low-maintenance living and an ideal lock-and-leave option.\r\n* Sea Views: Enjoy expansive sea views from the master suite.\r\n\r\nOur vendor is ready to negotiate. A fantastic opportunity in this enviable location.",
